  "display_title": "The Tutorial Is Too Tough!",
  "description": "Lee Ho-Jae had given up his life as a pro gamer, until one day he received a mysterious message:\n\n*“Congratulations! You’ve been invited to the Tutorial World.”*\n\nIntrigued, he enters the game and confidently chooses “hell” difficulty, but soon learns that he is trapped there. With a mere 0.01% survival rate, Ho-Jae must somehow overcome the game’s agonizing challenges to figure out the real reason he was invited. This tutorial may be tough, but its secrets are what’s truly hellacious.\n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)",
